<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Hewlett-Packard raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Hewlett-Packard raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Cowen &amp; Co upgraded Hewlett-Packard Co to buy from hold, a Cowen source said.</p>
<p>-- The stock closed at 43-5/8 Friday.  </p>
<p>-- Cowen later confirmed the upgrade on the belief the company is gaining market share.</p>
</text>
